.TH smi-k8s-secret-set "1" "May 2026" "SMI Toolset" "SMI Infra Command"
.SH NAME
smi-k8s-secret-set \- Create or update a key in a Kubernetes Secret
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B smi-k8s-secret-set
.I NAMESPACE SECRET_NAME KEY VALUE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B smi-k8s-secret-set
creates a Kubernetes Secret (or updates an existing one) with a single key/value pair.
It uses \fBkubectl create secret generic --dry-run=client | kubectl apply\fR so it is safe to run repeatedly.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Set the Anthropic API key in the generator namespace:
.PP
.B smi-k8s-secret-set generator generator-secrets anthropic-api-key sk-ant-...
